<span class="cat-badge">Guide &middot; Rentals</span>
<h1>Automatic Scooter Braking: Checks and Common Mistakes for Hanoi Scooter Riders</h1>
<p>Braking is the skill Hanoi traffic asks for most, and the braking mistakes renters make are consistent: levers checked on day one and never again, over-reliance on the rear brake, and braking habits built on dry mornings then carried into the first wet afternoon. This guide pairs the daily checks with the errors they prevent.</p>
<p>We cover the brake portion of the daily inspection, the handover tests, the braking mistakes in traffic and in rain, and what to tell the shop when brakes change. Start at the <a href="/hanoi-scooter-rental/">Hanoi scooter rental</a> hub, budget with the <a href="/hanoi-motorbike-rental-cost/">Hanoi motorbike rental cost</a> guide, and read the <a href="/monthly-motorbike-rental-hanoi/">monthly motorbike rental in Hanoi</a> guide for long stays. The <a href="/hanoi-scooter-rental/automatic-scooter-braking-selection-guide/">braking selection guide</a> covers the machine-choice side of the same topic.</p>
<nav class="toc">
<ol>
<li><a href="#sec-1">The daily brake check</a></li>
